{
	"nodes": [
		{
			"id": "351cdb84a12d0ceb",
			"type": "group",
			"label": "repo-ingest (skill): describe a repository in the wiki",
			"x": -60,
			"y": -200,
			"width": 3620,
			"height": 640,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "ef2d30128053e386",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**context** for the repository: described, behind, instructions, policies",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 100,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "a04dc2e91aef1d92",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**source** capture `repository`: the snapshot at the head commit",
			"x": 380,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 100,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "871f448c8edd0fb6",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Described before?",
			"x": 760,
			"y": 20,
			"width": 220,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "ce4d77071074de40",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Read the snapshot, the instruction files, the entry points, the main packages",
			"x": 1080,
			"y": -140,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 100,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "a274c8fea90d7a55",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Read `git log` and the diff from `described` to head, and what they touch",
			"x": 1080,
			"y": 100,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 100,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "ad8763e09261ae44",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**wiki-extract** on the snapshot's chunks",
			"x": 1480,
			"y": -140,
			"width": 260,
			"height": 80,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "911afc04cba6da53",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Your own items from the code: components (entities), patterns (concepts), conventions (policies), each located by path:line",
			"x": 1480,
			"y": 60,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 140,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "0dbdf7a1672096b1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**match**",
			"x": 1880,
			"y": 20,
			"width": 200,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "1fb9dfd03af2492c",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**wiki-draft** per slice",
			"x": 2180,
			"y": 20,
			"width": 240,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "11c03a58ef121752",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Plan: the writes, and a modify of the repository page; `absorbs` the snapshot",
			"x": 2520,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 100,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "0a4b3f8f85dfd43c",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**The user** reviews and says yes",
			"x": 2900,
			"y": 10,
			"width": 240,
			"height": 80,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "cc7ae8a13512dee4",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**change** apply: sets `described`",
			"x": 3240,
			"y": 10,
			"width": 240,
			"height": 80,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "9c6d8ec4f6cda820",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "TODO, FIXME, and roadmap items: candidate stubs, never wiki pages",
			"x": 1480,
			"y": 280,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 100,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "5767d66322662df1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**thread** open for each stub the user picks",
			"x": 3240,
			"y": 260,
			"width": 260,
			"height": 80,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "45148a0f295eaad5",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Legend**\n\n- cyan: tool (code)\n- yellow: skill or agent (model)\n- purple: document or entity\n- green: hook (code, automatic)\n- orange: the user\n- red: a gate or a refusal",
			"x": -400,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 260
		}
	],
